{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EuBnLhJtw91794558100.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>達卡青奧，港隊吳海迪男子滑浪風帆奪銀。</p><p></p><p>14場扣除最差成績三場，吳海迪其中有兩場第一、三場第二及四場第三，共獲28分，輸冠軍希臘代表16分，但以20分力壓第三的突尼斯選手。</p><p></p><p>港隊相隔16年再獲青奧滑浪風帆獎牌，追平鄭俊樑2010年銀牌成績，香港代表團暫奪歷屆最多2金2銀3銅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:39:16.992184+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:18.131765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:32:34.160469+00:00","content_hash":"abc453c1a9ddafe05db7cd731720281952f5b3a15cae768e2938ee004bfe2670","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:39:16.992184+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}